        <section class="why-heartland_content-wrapper">
            <h2>Why Heartland Community College?</h2>
            <div class="content-separator">
                <img alt="" height="" loading="lazy" src="/_assets/images/GettyImages-1500034910 1.webp" width=""/>
            </div>
            <div class="why-heartland_content-image-wrapper">
                <div>
                                         <img alt="" height="534" loading="lazy" src="/_assets/images/homepage/asides/why-hcc-aside.jpg" width="799"/>
                </div>
                <img alt="" height="" loading="lazy" src="/_assets/images/GettyImages-1500034910 1.webp" width=""/>
                <a class="cta" href="/application/index.html" target="_parent">Apply Now</a>
            </div>
            <div class="wysiwyg">
                                                <p>At Heartland, we empower students through high-quality education, personalized support, and a vibrant campus community. Whether you're earning credits to transfer, gaining hands-on skills for the workforce, or exploring new opportunities, our programs are designed to help you succeed.</p>
<p>Affordable tuition and financial aid options make it all possible. Start your journey with us today.</p>
                        </div>
        </section>
